Students and developers who <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/23/apple-announces-wwdc-2026-dates/">won the lottery</a> to attend the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/wwdc/">WWDC 2026</a> Special Event at <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-park/">Apple Park</a> on June 8 have started receiving their invites.<br/>
